 "remarks": "Ideally located just moments from downtown, train to NYC, and schools, 33 Fairview Avenue offers the very best of Darien living. Thoughtfully transformed by the current owners, this home seamlessly blends timeless charm with modern sophistication, featuring detailed millwork, beautiful built-ins, refinished floors, updated bathrooms, and a stunning kitchen refresh with new countertops and appliances. The first floor is both elegant and functional, beginning with a formal sitting room adorned with custom paneling and built-ins, which flows effortlessly into a private office complete with a hidden Murphy bed - perfect for guests. The formal dining room is dinner-party ready with chic mural wallpaper by Susan Harter and designer lighting, and connects to a fabulous butler's pantry featuring a second sink, dishwasher, and abundant storage. The open kitchen and family room is truly the heart of the home - an entertainer's dream with an eat-in area and sliders that lead to a spacious deck for seamless indoor-outdoor living. Upstairs, four well-appointed bedrooms provide comfortable retreats. The primary suite is a standout, offering a serene escape with a marble bathroom and exceptional storage, including a dreamy walk-in closet and an entire wall of custom built-in closets and dresser space. Located in the sought-after Royle School district, this turnkey home is a rare opportunity to enjoy refined living in one of Darien's most convenient and desirable neighborhoods.",
